<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3PVS20JST/2024_The_PoolCleaner_W3PVS20JST_Amazon_Assets_Carousel_02_173e.png"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Hayward Poolvergnuegen Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="A 2-wheel suction cleaner with patented self-adjusting turbine vanes for maximum power at any flow."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Hayward-W3PVS20JST-Poolvergnuegen"/><meta property="og:title" content="Hayward Poolvergnuegen Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="A 2-wheel suction cleaner with patented self-adjusting turbine vanes for maximum power at any flow."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3PVS20JST/2024_The_PoolCleaner_W3PVS20JST_Amazon_Assets_Carousel_02_173e.png"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Hayward Poolvergnuegen<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://commerce.hayward-pool-assets.com/magento/2026/W3PVS20JST/2024_The_PoolCleaner_W3PVS20JST_Amazon_Assets_Carousel_02_173e.png" alt="Hayward Poolvergnuegen" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Hayward Poolvergnuegen (The PoolCleaner) is a legendary suction-side cleaner. Unlike the robots on this list, it plugs into your skimmer or dedicated suction line and uses your pool pump&#x27;s power to move. It is famous for its ability to handle large debris without clogging and its robust 2-wheel drive system that navigates obstacles with ease.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>This is the best choice for:</p><ul><li>Owners who want a <strong>suction-side cleaner</strong> (no electricity in the pool).</li><li>Pools with <strong>variable speed pumps</strong> (it works well at low flow).</li><li>Those who want a 'set it and forget it' cleaner that stays in the pool 24/7.</li><li>Budget-conscious buyers who don't want to spend $800+.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Skip this if:</p><ul><li><strong>Your pump is weak:</strong> It relies entirely on your pool pump's suction.</li><li><strong>You want walls scrubbed:</strong> It climbs walls but doesn't scrub them like a robot with brushes.</li><li><strong>You want fine dust filtration:</strong> It sends debris to your pool filter, so you'll be backwashing more often.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>Self-Adjusting Turbine Vanes:</strong> Allows passage of large debris without clogging.</li><li><strong>2-Wheel Drive:</strong> Deep-tread tires for obstacle climbing.</li><li><strong>Pre-Programmed Steering:</strong> Ensures full pool coverage and prevents getting stuck.</li><li><strong>Adjustable Roller Skirt:</strong> Maintains suction on uneven surfaces.</li><li><strong>Interchangeable Throats:</strong> Optimize suction for different pump strengths.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Uncloggable Design:</strong> The Poolvergnuegen features patented self-adjusting turbine vanes. These flexible paddles allow large debris like leaves and rocks to pass through the cleaner without jamming the engine. This makes it incredibly reliable in leafy pools.</p><p><strong>2-Wheel Drive:</strong> The robust tires have deep treads that allow it to climb over main drains and uneven surfaces. It has a pre-programmed steering sequence that causes the left wheel to periodically reverse, turning the cleaner to ensure it covers the whole pool and doesn't get stuck in corners.</p><p><strong>Low Flow Efficiency:</strong> One of its biggest selling points is its ability to operate at low suction/flow rates. This makes it the ideal companion for modern variable-speed pumps, allowing you to clean the pool while running the pump on a low, energy-saving setting.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Extremely reliable and clog-resistant</li><li class="list-group-item">Works great with variable speed pumps</li><li class="list-group-item">No electricity required in the pool</li><li class="list-group-item">Can stay in the pool permanently</li><li class="list-group-item">Lower purchase price than robots</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Increases load on your pool filter</li><li class="list-group-item">Does not scrub surfaces (only vacuums)</li><li class="list-group-item">Hose can be unsightly in the pool</li><li class="list-group-item">Requires proper suction balancing</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>If you prefer the simplicity of a suction cleaner, the Hayward Poolvergnuegen is the gold standard. It&#x27;s a mechanical marvel that rarely jams and works happily with modern pumps. While it won&#x27;t scrub your tile line like a Dolphin, it keeps the pool floor spotless with zero effort and zero electricity costs (beyond your pump).</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Hayward Poolvergnuegen</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPM1Z5X?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Pentair-Prowler-930">Pentair Prowler 930</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->423</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Hayward-TigerShark-QC">Hayward TigerShark QC</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1489</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,