rengths.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Detailed Analysis\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUncloggable Design:\u003c/strong\u003e The Poolvergnuegen features patented self-adjusting turbine vanes. These flexible paddles allow large debris like leaves and rocks to pass through the cleaner without jamming the engine. This makes it incredibly reliable in leafy pools.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e2-Wheel Drive:\u003c/strong\u003e The robust tires have deep treads that allow it to climb over main drains and uneven surfaces. It has a pre-programmed steering sequence that causes the left wheel to periodically reverse, turning the cleaner to ensure it covers the whole pool and doesn't get stuck in corners.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLow Flow Efficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e One of its biggest selling points is its ability to operate at low suction/flow rates. This makes it the ideal companion for modern variable-speed pumps, allowing you to clean the pool while running the pump on a low, energy-saving setting.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Extremely reliable and clog-resistant\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Works great with variable speed pumps\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"No electricity required in the pool\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Can stay in the pool permanently\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Lower purchase price than robots\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Increases load on your pool filter\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Does not scrub surfaces (only vacuums)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Hose can be unsightly in the pool\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Requires proper suction balancing\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"If you prefer the simplicity of a suction cleaner, the Hayward Poolvergnuegen is the gold standard. It's a mechanical marvel that rarely jams and works happily with modern pumps. While it won't scrub your tile line like a Dolphin, it keeps the pool floor spotless with zero effort and zero electricity costs (beyond your pump).\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Hayward Poolvergnuegen\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SPM1Z5X?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{